nazuchem-ir source provenance
=============================

This crate extracts the original ReShiki shared naming vocabulary from
src/naming.rs at commit 8e09fa7f89e47d8465772eabf2ef7f2ea491af3a.
The types, rule-assessment text and serialization attributes are original
ReShiki code, licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0. See LICENSE-MIT and LICENSE-APACHE.

Git history records the introduction of NameStatus and NameReason in
001003b2444f8cec530b7f2b06f193d7b9c9b92c, AlternativeName in
0d10886c93f6f7aa673f4179739143986d392a01 and IsotopeStyle in
381ac4164154afecf04bb4a89d8eef32eeb52190. Later ReShiki commits extend
these declarations and their messages; the extraction preserves the pinned
source's complete current definitions.

This crate contains shared vocabulary only. The naming engines' ported
algorithms and chemistry kernel are outside this crate.
